@startuml
title SD-F01 — OTP and cart version
caption To-Be draft | PRD-01–03 / SA-F01 · Identity / Cart
actor Customer as C
boundary Web
control Identity
database PostgreSQL as DB
participant "OTP adapter" as OTP
C -> Web : Initiate challenge
Web -> Identity : Normalize contact and rate-limit
Identity -> DB : Persist verifier and expiry
Identity -> OTP : Send under deadline
C -> Web : Verify code
Web -> DB : TX-01 lock and consume challenge
alt Valid unused code
 DB --> Web : Account session
 C -> Web : Load or change own cart
 Web -> DB : TX-02 owner lock and version check
 alt Version current
  DB --> Web : New cart version
 else Stale write
  Web --> C : VERSION_CONFLICT, refetch
 end
else Expired, replayed or provider failure
 Web --> C : Safe failure, no session
end
@enduml
